{
  "name": "ShowCapacityAzoneInfo",
  "summary": "查询可用区的当前容量",
  "tags": "容量管理",
  "productshort": "ManageOneOCHCS",
  "region_id": "cn-north-4",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/capacity/v1/capbase/azones/{azoneId}/resource-types/{resourceType}/current-capacities": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询可用区的当前容量",
        "description": "查询指定的可用区的指定资源类型的当前容量信息。查询范围:仅支持查询本级ManageOne容量数据。\n\n  |SLA项|定义|\n  |-----|-----|\n  |请求成功率| ≥99.9%|\n  |可用性|Tier 1|\n  |数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1min|\n  |吞吐量|1200 次/分钟|\n  |TP50请求时延|500 ms|\n  |TP99.9请求时延|2000 ms|",
        "x-precautions": "调用该接口需要“资源池监控数据查询”权限,归属权限组:运维中心>资源池容量。\n错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运维面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 容量管理”章节。\n",
        "tags": [
          "容量管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "ShowCapacityAzoneInfo",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "x-filter": "openapi",
        "x-plane": "OM",
        "x-opseverity": "Minor",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "azoneId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "可用区的ID,获取参考“资源管理”章节中“查询指定资源类型的所有实例”接口,接口url为“rest/cmdb/v1/instances/SYS_Azone”,具体值为响应示例中“objList” 中“resId”。范围是0 - FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF,16进制32位数。"
          },
          {
            "name": "resourceType",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^(cpu|memory|storage-pool|bms|npu|gpu)(,(cpu|memory|storage-pool|bms|npu|gpu)){0,9}$",
            "description": "资源类型,支持同时传入多个资源类型同时查询多种资源类型的容量信息,传入多个资源类型时使用逗号分隔,可取值为:\n* cpu\n* memory\n* storage-pool\n* bms\n* npu\n* gpu"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "返回指定可用区位置下各个资源类型的容量信息,含实际容量和超分后的容量信息。实际容量不支持cpu实际使用量和实际剩余量核数统计,cpu实际使用量和实际剩余量核数默认返回为0。如果超分后容量信息中oversubscriptionRatio的值为null或0时,表示不支持超分,请使用实际容量信息。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ResCapacity"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "cpu": null,
                "memory": {
                  "oversubscriptionCapacity": {
                    "oversubscriptionRatio": 1,
                    "totalCapacity": {
                      "unit": "MB",
                      "capacityValue": "55639",
                      "displayCapacity": "54.33 GB"
                    },
                    "allocatedCapacity": {
                      "unit": "MB",
                      "capacityValue": "27582",
                      "displayCapacity": "26.94 GB",
                      "ratio": 49.57
                    },
